{"id":"613536","name":"白菜发面蒸包","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/613536/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香菇、白菜洗净。","img":"images/613536/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切好。","img":"images/613536/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大葱切好。","img":"images/613536/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"猪肉切碎，蚝油、生抽、姜、料酒拌匀腌制10分钟。","img":"images/613536/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"所有食材放在一起，放入芝麻油、玉米油、盐。","img":"images/613536/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/613536/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"提前发好的面团。","img":"images/613536/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉面排气，分成均匀的剂子，擀成包子皮。","img":"images/613536/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入馅料。","img":"images/613536/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"包子全部包好，二次醒发。","img":"images/613536/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"冷水上锅，大火烧开转中火慢慢蒸17分钟。","img":"images/613536/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"关火焖3分钟，出锅。","img":"images/613536/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"暄软好吃。","img":"images/613536/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"白菜包子，好吃又营养。","img":"images/613536/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}